---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 26,
  title: 'Day 26',
  date: '2026-09-30',
  description: 'First day, of learning in PŁ',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I wake up ate breakfast, and I went to "Biedronka" to buy some
          food, Earlier I saw that this shop is open from 6:00 am, but It was
          closed, so I needed to go to other "Biedronka" shop, after I reaturned
          to dormitory, I went to PŁ, becouse I didn't know where is my class,
          so I needed go early, to find it in time, after that I went to my
          class, and I met my teachers, they are very nice, and I hope I'll
          learn a lot of things from them, after that I went to dormitory, from
          what I wen to buy big Pan, becouse recently I saw that I need one more
          Pan, I trided to make waffles, but I't went wrong, I don't know why,
          I'll try to make them better next time, after that I learn math a bit
          after that,I found offer of a gaming chair, and I bring it to my
          dormitory, It's very comfortable, now I can sit longer and do some
          producive things, I made dinner and read book before I went to sleep
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        Tomorrow I have my first lab classes, I'm curious how it will be, I know
        It's very important, so I'll try my best.+ I'll try to make this
        course....... My gosh, I thought I'd made it quicker, but It's becouse I
        don't like that way he learns, so It's hard to sit to do this
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 3/10, I bring important things to dormitory, and learn at
          studies
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={3} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
